ing more transparent, informed, and buyer-first. If you're driven by ownership, curiosity, and solving meaningful problems, you'll fit right in. </p><div class="careers-hero-buttons" style="justify-content: center;"><a href="#openings" class="sd-btn-gold" data-no-modal="true"><span>Explore Open Roles</span></a></div></div></section></main><div class="brand-divider premium-reveal"></div><section class="careers-section"><div class="careers-container"><div class="section-header" style="text-align: center;"><div class="hero-kicker" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;"><span>OUR VALUES</span></div></div><div class="values-timeline"><div class="value-node"><div class="value-circle"><i data-feather="heart"></i></div><div class="value-text-block"><h4 class="value-title">Buyer First</h4><p class="value-desc">Every decision starts with what's best for the client.</p></div></div><div class="value-node"><div class="value-circle"><i data-feather="shield"></i></div><div class="value-text-block"><h4 class="value-title">Integrity Over Sales</h4><p class="value-desc">We value trust over transactions.</p></div></div><div class="value-node"><div class="value-circle"><i data-feather="target"></i></div><div class="value-text-block"><h4 class="value-title">Extreme Ownership</h4><p class="value-desc">We take responsibility, solve problems, and deliver results.</p></div></div><div class="value-node"><div class="value-circle"><i data-feather="book-open"></i></div><div class="value-text-block"><h4 class="value-title">Continuous Learning</h4><p class="value-desc">We stay curious, adapt quickly, and improve every day.</p></div></div><div class="value-node"><div class="value-circle"><i data-feather="check-circle"></i></div><div class="value-text-block"><h4 class="value-title">Excellence in Execution</h4><p class="value-desc">We believe great outcomes come from attention to detail and consistent execution.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div class="brand-divider premium-reveal"></div><section class="careers-section"><div class="careers-container"><div class="life-split"><div class="life-collage"><img src="../style-guide/assets/team_culture_group.webp?v=FLUSH_1791020747" alt="Acre&amp;Key Team" class="collage-img img-team-main" width="1024" height="680" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="../style-guide/assets/office_culture_small_1.webp?v=FLUSH_1791020747" alt="Team Work Session" class="collage-img img-small-1" width="1376" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img src="../style-guide/assets/office_culture_small_2.webp?v=FLUSH_1791020747" alt="Colleagues talking" class="collage-img img-small-2" width="1376" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="life-content"><div class="hero-kicker"><span>LIFE AT ACRE&amp;KEY</span></div><h2 class="section-title">A Culture of Professional Dilemma Solvers</h2><p class="life-desc"> We work in a flat, high-trust environment where data reigns supreme and customer safety is the metric of success. Our day comprises civic diligence audits, client briefings, technology builds, and team brainstorms. </p><ul class="life-bullets"><li class="life-bullet-item"><div class="bullet-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="bullet-text">Ownership: We define, shape, and deliver our own timelines.</span></li><li class="life-bullet-item"><div class="bullet-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="bullet-text">Innovation: Using tech, data maps, and RERA insights to automate due diligence.</span></li><li class="life-bullet-item"><div class="bullet-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="bullet-text">Learning: Constant deep-dives into property laws, architectural safety, and economics.</span></li><li class="life-bullet-item"><div class="bullet-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="bullet-text">Transparency: Honest feedback inside the office translates to honest feedback for clients.</span></li><li class="life-bullet-item"><div class="bullet-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="bullet-text">Collaboration: Fusing engineering, advisory, operations, and analysis into one solid shield.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><div class="brand-divider premium-reveal" id="openings"></div><section class="careers-section"><div class="careers-container"><div class="section-header" style="text-align: center;"><div class="hero-kicker" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;"><span>CURRENT OPENINGS</span></div><h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: center;">Explore Opportunities at <span class="brand-inline-text">acre&amp;key</span></h2></div><div class="openings-grid"><div class="department-section"><h3 class="department-title">Founder's Office</h3><div class="roles-list"><a href="/careers/executive-assistant-to-the-founder/" class="role-item" style="text-decoration: none;"><div><div class="role-name-text">EA to the founder</div></div><i data-feather="arrow-right" class="role-apply-icon"></i></a></div></div><div class="department-section"><h3 class="department-title">Sales &amp; Advisory</h3><div class="roles-list"><a href="/careers/property-consultant-inside-sales/" class="role-item" style="text-decoration: none;"><div><div class="role-name-text">Property Consultant (IS)</div></div><i data-feather="arrow-right" class="role-apply-icon"></i></a><a href="/careers/home-buyer-advisor/" class="role-item" style="text-decoration: none;"><div><div class="role-name-text">Home Buyer Advisor</div></div><i data-feather="arrow-right" class="role-apply-icon"></i></a></div></div></div></div></section><footer class="site-footer" id="footer">
